## Conference Targets (Where to Submit)

### Tier 1 (Most Prestigious)
- **NeurIPS** (December) - General ML, highly competitive
- **ICLR** (May) - Deep learning focus
- **ICML** (July) - Machine learning theory + practice

### Tier 2 (Strong NLP Focus)
- **ACL** (July) - Main NLP conference
- **EMNLP** (December) - Empirical methods in NLP
- **NAACL** (June) - North American chapter of ACL

### Tier 3 (More Accessible, Still Respected)
- **EACL** (April) - European chapter of ACL
- **CoNLL** (November) - Computational Natural Language Learning
- **SustaiNLP Workshop** - Perfect fit for your efficiency focus
- **TinyML Research Symposium** - Perfect fit for on-device AI

### Arxiv First (Recommended)
- Post preprint 2-3 months before conference deadline
- Get early feedback
- Iterate before formal submission

