## Common Research Paper Mistakes to Avoid

❌ **Don't:**
- Overclaim results ("Revolutionary", "Breakthrough")
- Cherry-pick best runs
- Compare only to weak baselines
- Ignore failure cases
- Skip ablation studies
- Forget to release code

✅ **Do:**
- Be honest about limitations
- Report statistical significance
- Compare to strong, recent baselines
- Discuss when your method fails
- Show what each component contributes
- Make work reproducible

