Week 3-4: Demo + Validation  
├── Build interactive web demo
├── Test on low-end device (Raspberry Pi)
└── Recruit 10 beta testers

Week 5-6: Paper Writing
├── Write methods + experiments sections
├── Create figures and tables
└── Get feedback from advisor/peers

Week 7-8: Polish + Submit
├── Create supplementary materials
├── Record demo video
├── Submit to arXiv
└── Submit to conference

Total: 2 months to research paper + working demos
```

### Training From Scratch Decision
**Do it ONLY if:**
- PAKD fine-tuning doesn't show significant gains (unlikely)
- You need architectural novelty claims
- You have 1-2 extra months
- You have consistent access to TPU/GPU

**Otherwise:** Focus on PAKD methodology + inference optimizations (your actual contributions)

